{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using pca_n2000 encoder, comparing against the scvi_n200 baseline (config_003). Validation accuracy of 0.591 (F1: 0.573) is lower than the scvi_n200 model's 0.650, suggesting the scvi_n200 encoder's performance advantage persists in multiprofile data. Uncertainty remains about whether pca_n2000 could achieve similar performance with alternative configurations or if other RNA encoders might yield better results."
}

